  "body": "@RheagalFire, thanks for adding LiteLLM support. FLUJO is developing a contributor and maintainer program in #576. Would you be interested in a bounded contribution or core-change review, followed by a disposable release/recovery practice run? The current guide and tooling are in #579, #603 and #614; the practice uses synthetic data and a pinned public release. Participation is voluntary, and role scope, access and evidence consent would be agreed with you before any maintainer assignment. If interested, please let us know your preferred task or area and availability.",
